  "details": "While holding the camera and pressing trigger button and you have a pin saved it cycles between the last two pins as intended, be it between 1 & 2, 1 & 3, or 2&3. But when switching between the two pins this way any camera setting changes like mask, behavior, anchor, etc will reset to the last saved settings when switched off of and back on of. The only way to get the settings to save is by manually changing off the the pin via the GUI.\n\n1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Pull out stream camera\n\n3. Select a pin that isn't what you are presently on\n\n4. Change some camera settings, switch off pin via trigger button, then back on to it in the same way, and the camera settings for that pin will revert to whatever its last saved state was before making the settings changes\n\nExpected behavior: The pin settings save no matter what method I use to switch off it.",
